  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Qualify M4-W01-C02-T1 through one real compiled missing-contract RED, 25 independent GREEN tests and eight NuGet-only consumer oracles. Deliver dw.tools.math.symbolics 0.5.0-preview.1 with a closed, provider-free real exact rule (x²-c²)/(x-c) => restricted(x+c,x!=c) and typed point refusals. Lock the new projects, inspect three local NuGet artifacts and record actual SHA-256s. Satisfy EXT-SYMBOLIC only from bounded C01 provider evidence while leaving C02-T2 unstarted.",
    "value": "Provide an independently consumable typed Math symbolic primitive that cannot silently fill a removed singularity, without making Angouri or a broker a production dependency.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "One compiled reflection RED demonstrates the new public typed symbolic cancellation API is missing from a real empty project before production implementation is installed.",
      "Twenty-five independent semantic GREEN tests cover exact and fractional poles, variable identity, conflicting assumptions, bounded operands, canonical IR restrictions and no implicit approximation.",
      "Eight source-independent oracles execute through a local NuGet-only .NET 10 client with a closed external feed, direct symbolics package reference and transitive IR/quantities dependencies.",
      "A separate C# post-packaging inspector records actual archive identities and SHA-256s for dw.quantities, dw.tools.math.ir and new dw.tools.math.symbolics without recalculating DWF authority hashes.",
      "New lowercase .NET product/test projects, explicit lockfiles and solution membership are staged with complete controlled mutation paths, then checked through locked restore/build and relevant tests.",
      "EXT-SYMBOLIC becomes satisfied only for C01's documented bounded provider-selection and process-limit evidence, not general Angouri deployment or conditional text-to-IR adoption.",
      "C02-T1 R/G/V and T1 reach done while C02, M4-W01 and M4 remain in progress; T2 and C03 stay unstarted, with no public feed, provider integration or AURA/dw.discovery broker claims."
    ],
    "nextAction": "After durable RS055 success, independently qualify M4-W01-C02-T2 provider-condition rejection, assumption transport, invalid IR/domain boundaries and consumer compatibility before closing C02.",
    "achievements": [
      {
        "projectNode": "M4-W01-C02-T1-R",
        "achievement": "Execute the independent compiled missing-API RED against a real empty symbolics assembly and record its exact failed public contract assertion."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M4-W01-C02-T1-G",
        "achievement": "Implement the provider-free exact rational cancellation bridge and pass 25 independent scientific GREEN tests plus eight NuGet-only consumer oracles, retaining typed x!=c exclusions."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M4-W01-C02-T1-V",
        "achievement": "Verify locked .NET solution, full relevant symbolics/IR/quantity regressions, three NuGet manifest identities and observed package SHA-256s, and explicitly limited provider ownership."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M4-W01-C02-T1",
        "achievement": "Deliver and qualify the narrow M4-W01-C02-T1 typed symbolic IR product contract, controlled RED/GREEN evidence and independent local package consumer without implying C02 or M4 completion."
      }
    ]
  },
